  "description": "Before Yeonghwan killed someone, he had a secret that no one could ever be allowed to discover.\n\nThe only man who witnessed that secret.\nAnd the person who hid the evidence inside his own body.\n\nHis damn first love.\n\nYeonghwan keeps Jeongwon under constant watch, a leash fastened around his neck, not allowing him even the slightest chance to escape.\nBut faced with a deal offered by the first love he can neither kill nor let go, he eventually wavers.\n\n_\"Why enjoy it for 30 minutes when you could enjoy it for three days?\"_\n\nThe man who once confessed his feelings to him, only to be brutally rejected,\nnow begins tearing into the deepest part of Yeonghwan.\n\n_(Source: RIDI, translated)_",
